<title>UK: FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of UK company results expected in week ending April 11 include -</p>
<p>COMPANY-------------PFT/DIV/EPS--CONSENSUS----RANGE-----PVS</p>
<p>THURSDAY, April 10</p>
<p>RMC	  F   ***     PFT	262.0  248.8-275.0    329.0</p>
<p>			     DIV	 26.0   26.0-27.5	25.3</p>
<p>			     EPS	 62.08  59.0-66.5	77.0</p>
<p>(TED - PFT 268.0; DIV 26.23; EPS 61.5; PFT RANGE 249.7-311.0)</p>
<p>FRIDAY, April 11</p>
<p>- no major companies reporting</p>
<p>NOTES</p>
<p>*** RMC's profit last year came to 341.7 million stg including exceptional items</p>
<p>**** Tarmac's profit last year was 20.3 million stg after exceptional items</p>
<p>All profit figures are pretax, exclude exceptional items unless otherwise stated and are in millions stg. Dividends are total net and quoted as pence per share.</p>
<p>			     ----oOo----</p>
<p>--John Sutherland, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7945</p>
